quran[28]{c,v,t}:
  83,7,"No, indeed! The record of the wicked is in Sijjin."
  83,8,And what will make you realise what Sijjin is?
  83,9,(It is) an inscribed book (kept in the record room of Hell).
  83,10,"Woe to the deniers on that Day,"
  83,11,those who deny the Day of Retribution!
  83,12,And none denies it except every sinful transgressor.
  83,13,"Whenever Our revelations are recited to him, he says: ‘(These are) tales of the ancients.’"
  83,14,"No, indeed! Instead, whatever (evil) they have been earning has stained their hearts."
  83,15,"Undoubtedly, they will be veiled from their Lord that Day."
  83,16,Then they will enter Hell to burn.
  83,17,Then they will be told: ‘This is what you used to deny.’
  83,18,"Undoubtedly, the record of the pious is in ‘Illiyyun."
  83,19,And what will make you realise what ‘Illiyyun is?
  83,20,(It is) an inscribed book (kept in the record room of Paradise).
  83,21,The (angels) nearest (to Allah) remain present here (as witnesses).
  83,22,"Indeed, the virtuous shall be in Bliss,"
  83,23,"(reclining) upon couches, they will gaze around (the beautiful sights of Paradise)."
  83,24,You will perceive upon their faces the delightful freshness of Bliss.
  83,25,They will be served with a sealed pure wine.
  83,26,"Its last sip will be (as fragrant as) musk. So, for it, let the aspirants strive to aspire."
  83,27,And the flavour (of this drink) is (seasoned) from Tasnim.
  83,28,(It is) a spring from which those nearest (to Allah) will drink.
  83,29,"Indeed, the criminals used to laugh at the believers."
  83,30,"Whenever they (the believers) passed by them, they would wink at one another."
  83,31,"When they returned to their people, they would return jokingly,"
  83,32,"and when they saw them (i.e. the believers), they would say: ‘They are the ones astray.’"
  83,33,"Yet, they were not sent to be watchers over them."
  83,34,"So today, the believers will laugh at the disbelievers,"
